(3981647, 567579, 68256, '<td valign="top">Great idea and execution, I''m voting high for this.  I would have liked it better if the little train had more space to go into...like if the focus point was the upper right and it was heading in torward the camera...I like it a lot as is though.</td>', 'Great idea and execution, I''m voting high for this.  I would have liked it better if the little train had more space to go into...like if the focus point was the upper right and it was heading in torward the camera...I like it a lot as is though.', '2007-08-08 17:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3981657, 567332, 68256, '<td valign="top">I love the subject and composition.  Good texture in the fur too.  I like the framing provided by the dark surroundings also.  On the negative side, my eye is drawn to the left side where the focus seems to be the best and that part of the subject seems to be disconnected from the head...it makes for a confusing composition.  Overall though I like the photo.</td>', 'I love the subject and composition.  Good texture in the fur too.  I like the framing provided by the dark surroundings also.  On the negative side, my eye is drawn to the left side where the focus seems to be the best and that part of the subject seems to be disconnected from the head...it makes for a confusing composition.  Overall though I like the photo.', '2007-08-08 17:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3981661, 565967, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very dark and brooding for such a chearful subject :)  It works for me, but it seems like when I have "dark" photos on DPC they don''t do as well.  I think you have created great mood and character for your toy and I give you high marks for it.</td>', 'Very dark and brooding for such a chearful subject :)  It works for me, but it seems like when I have "dark" photos on DPC they don''t do as well.  I think you have created great mood and character for your toy and I give you high marks for it.', '2007-08-08 17:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3981668, 567112, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition and pattern!  Really looks nice to me and draws my eye throughout the photo.  You have done well taking an "uninteresting" subject that has been photographed a lot and making it work. 9</td>', 'Very interesting composition and pattern!  Really looks nice to me and draws my eye throughout the photo.  You have done well taking an "uninteresting" subject that has been photographed a lot and making it work. 9', '2007-08-08 17:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3981675, 567351, 68256, '<td valign="top">Having a big family this is all to familiar to me!  Great composition and dramatic lighting.  Even if I didn''t "get it" this would be a great photo for its simple design and lighting.  Congratulations on taking such a wonderful photo.  9</td>', 'Having a big family this is all to familiar to me!  Great composition and dramatic lighting.  Even if I didn''t "get it" this would be a great photo for its simple design and lighting.  Congratulations on taking such a wonderful photo.  9', '2007-08-08 17:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3981682, 567689, 68256, '<td valign="top">Poor little fellow, I feel sorry for him....That aside there are a lot of nice things about this photo, lighting, composition, story telling...I''m giving it high marks but I''m wondering if it would have had more impact as low key with dramatic shadows?</td>', 'Poor little fellow, I feel sorry for him....That aside there are a lot of nice things about this photo, lighting, composition, story telling...I''m giving it high marks but I''m wondering if it would have had more impact as low key with dramatic shadows?', '2007-08-08 17:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
