(3981862, 566986, 82438, '<td valign="top">GREAT composition! I love your take on this challenge, very creative. I love the fact that you not only photographed a child''s toy, but you also put them to use in the very way they were intended to be used, as a learning tool for spelling and learning visuals! Keep up that creativeness!</td>', 'GREAT composition! I love your take on this challenge, very creative. I love the fact that you not only photographed a child''s toy, but you also put them to use in the very way they were intended to be used, as a learning tool for spelling and learning visuals! Keep up that creativeness!', '2007-08-08 18:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3981879, 567760, 67237, '<td valign="top">nice shot<br/>it would have been so much better without that distracting white thing in the bg.</td>', 'nice shotit would have been so much better without that distracting white thing in the bg.', '2007-08-08 19:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3981882, 566576, 82088, '<td valign="top">Forgotten seems to be a popular theme for this challenge, but I really like the way you executed the idea.  I would have enjoyed the picture more if the top shelf was cropped out though.  Great job!</td>', 'Forgotten seems to be a popular theme for this challenge, but I really like the way you executed the idea.  I would have enjoyed the picture more if the top shelf was cropped out though.  Great job!', '2007-08-08 19:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3981883, 567544, 67237, '<td valign="top">one of the best shots in the challenge..it should do well</td>', 'one of the best shots in the challenge..it should do well', '2007-08-08 19:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3981917, 567114, 67237, '<td valign="top">good light. a bit too much in the face though.<br/>Too bad the head of the Baby Bear has that kind of red hat on. I think that element does not add to the image, but becomes distracting to the point you could not tell it is a bear until you see below her arms or you read the title.</td>', 'good light. a bit too much in the face though.Too bad the head of the Baby Bear has that kind of red hat on. I think that element does not add to the image, but becomes distracting to the point you could not tell it is a bear until you see below her arms or you read the title.', '2007-08-08 19:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3981918, 567169, 82088, '<td valign="top">I really enjoyed your entry.  I was starting to get disappointed going through the entries, there were a lot of them that were very demented or depressing.  Your photo is what I think of when I think of a Childs Toy, happy and fun.  Great photo, 10!</td>', 'I really enjoyed your entry.  I was starting to get disappointed going through the entries, there were a lot of them that were very demented or depressing.  Your photo is what I think of when I think of a Childs Toy, happy and fun.  Great photo, 10!', '2007-08-08 19:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3981926, 567573, 67237, '<td valign="top">well executed</td>', 'well executed', '2007-08-08 19:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3981932, 567908, 67237, '<td valign="top">interesting subject .<br/>execution technicals (focus and composition) could and should be better though. Itlooks snapish as it is.</td>', 'interesting subject .execution technicals (focus and composition) could and should be better though. Itlooks snapish as it is.', '2007-08-08 19:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3981949, 564779, 67237, '<td valign="top">there has to be a better place than the carpet to shoot this.</td>', 'there has to be a better place than the carpet to shoot this.', '2007-08-08 19:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
