(3983750, 567295, 79562, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - I would have preferred the ball to be in focus - good idea with the motion, but perhaps it would be stronger with a more static feel.  Great colors!</td>', 'Nice shot - I would have preferred the ball to be in focus - good idea with the motion, but perhaps it would be stronger with a more static feel.  Great colors!', '2007-08-09 11:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
