(3983863, 567753, 60862, '<td valign="top">Funny idea and a decent shot.  It looks more like a snapshot of a friend than a competitive image, though.  Mostly because of the centered composition.<br/> <br/>For a moodier, more emotional effect, try it again but having her facing the bar, maybe even leaning toward it a bit.  Put her on the left side of the image and the beer on the right.  That''ll improve the composition and also put some shadows on her face.  If you try it, I''d really enjoy seeing it. :)</td>', 'Funny idea and a decent shot.  It looks more like a snapshot of a friend than a competitive image, though.  Mostly because of the centered composition. For a moodier, more emotional effect, try it again but having her facing the bar, maybe even leaning toward it a bit.  Put her on the left side of the image and the beer on the right.  That''ll improve the composition and also put some shadows on her face.  If you try it, I''d really enjoy seeing it. :)', '2007-08-09 12:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
