(3984018, 564991, 70888, '<td valign="top">great idea cant believe i didnt think of this,lol i think compositionwise i would like to see the four limbs and no head or a head alone or the head setting as to be able to see the object a lil better,the head in front takes away from the humantype shape(body,head,four limbs)i think something like that would have evoked more emotion,great idea ...hope you can make sense of my ramblings - 7 for idea</td>', 'great idea cant believe i didnt think of this,lol i think compositionwise i would like to see the four limbs and no head or a head alone or the head setting as to be able to see the object a lil better,the head in front takes away from the humantype shape(body,head,four limbs)i think something like that would have evoked more emotion,great idea ...hope you can make sense of my ramblings - 7 for idea', '2007-08-09 13:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
