(3989899, 567930, 67841, '<td valign="top">PBS recently had a doc on ferrets that I found very interesting...<br/> <br/>This is a nice portrait of your pet, and you titled it about as best you could for this challenge and, yes, technically there are toys in your shot - but the fact that an animal, not a toy, is the focus of the shot detracts a little for me.</td>', 'PBS recently had a doc on ferrets that I found very interesting... This is a nice portrait of your pet, and you titled it about as best you could for this challenge and, yes, technically there are toys in your shot - but the fact that an animal, not a toy, is the focus of the shot detracts a little for me.', '2007-08-12 01:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
