(3989912, 567850, 67841, '<td valign="top">A little overexposed &amp; the lighting is flat - yes, I know your outside &amp; you could say you don''t have control over the light (e.g. the sun) but you do.  The first control you have is the time of day that you shoot.  The quality of light &amp; how it interacts with your subject is dramatically different at different times of the day.  The second control is using things like reflectors &amp; flags (black cloth) which work to shape the light for your subject.<br/> <br/>Maybe that''s more info than you ever would have wanted, but you never know...</td>', 'A little overexposed & the lighting is flat - yes, I know your outside & you could say you don''t have control over the light (e.g. the sun) but you do.  The first control you have is the time of day that you shoot.  The quality of light & how it interacts with your subject is dramatically different at different times of the day.  The second control is using things like reflectors & flags (black cloth) which work to shape the light for your subject. Maybe that''s more info than you ever would have wanted, but you never know...', '2007-08-12 02:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
