(3993690, 567925, 73235, '<td valign="top">Not sure whether b/w works here. There is not too much contrast between the plants and the toys. technically is a very good photo, sharp and crisp</td>', 'Not sure whether b/w works here. There is not too much contrast between the plants and the toys. technically is a very good photo, sharp and crisp', '2007-08-13 13:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3993711, 566352, 73235, '<td valign="top">composition could be chosen differently. the spoon is cropped, the bench is not parrallel to the picture frame, the shadow in the spoon could have been removed(turning the spoon or with reflectors). the 2 yellows don''t harmonize, they seem to conflict with each other. Hand and spoon seem to have no relation to each other. I''m not really sure what you want to show. If you spend a little more time thinking through your picture and even sketch it out on a piece of paper before you shoot, you will realize what you want to show.</td>', 'composition could be chosen differently. the spoon is cropped, the bench is not parrallel to the picture frame, the shadow in the spoon could have been removed(turning the spoon or with reflectors). the 2 yellows don''t harmonize, they seem to conflict with each other. Hand and spoon seem to have no relation to each other. I''m not really sure what you want to show. If you spend a little more time thinking through your picture and even sketch it out on a piece of paper before you shoot, you will realize what you want to show.', '2007-08-13 13:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3993718, 566547, 73235, '<td valign="top">did you try an other background, yellow? I like the angle of your photo, shows strength abd power. The only other consideration: watch out for these reflections, right where you focus on.</td>', 'did you try an other background, yellow? I like the angle of your photo, shows strength abd power. The only other consideration: watch out for these reflections, right where you focus on.', '2007-08-13 13:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
