(3999207, 566591, 43410, '<td valign="top">VERy nice job, congrats on your first ribbon!<br/> <br/>well deserved, enjoy!</td>', 'VERy nice job, congrats on your first ribbon! well deserved, enjoy!', '2007-08-15 02:09:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3999233, 567624, 5885, '<td valign="top">LMAO! Good one.</td>', 'LMAO! Good one.', '2007-08-15 02:16:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3999236, 566591, 64462, '<td valign="top">You''re genius...</td>', 'You''re genius...', '2007-08-15 02:17:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(3999256, 567312, 63267, '<td valign="top">Great picture, great score, and great finish Joe.  Don''t know why you received a 2 and some 3''s.  Maybe a disgruntled voter who ran way from home as a child, or was sucha  horrible parent to have kids run away from them.  None the less, great job!</td>', 'Great picture, great score, and great finish Joe.  Don''t know why you received a 2 and some 3''s.  Maybe a disgruntled voter who ran way from home as a child, or was sucha  horrible parent to have kids run away from them.  None the less, great job!', '2007-08-15 02:25:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3999278, 566848, 78303, '<td valign="top">I originally thought of trying to plug the controller into the football and show the cord attached.  Then, I played with taking shots at ground level with the football.  And, in the end, I decided on this one to try to make it look like they are one unit.  Two kids toys, one physical and one electronic, combined into one unit.<br/> <br/>I did darken it a little to put less emphasis on my dead grass in the shot.  I was laying on the ground to get this also, but there are no points given for awkward positioning in taking photos here.  Either way, I think the show did as well as expected.</td>', 'I originally thought of trying to plug the controller into the football and show the cord attached.  Then, I played with taking shots at ground level with the football.  And, in the end, I decided on this one to try to make it look like they are one unit.  Two kids toys, one physical and one electronic, combined into one unit. I did darken it a little to put less emphasis on my dead grass in the shot.  I was laying on the ground to get this also, but there are no points given for awkward positioning in taking photos here.  Either way, I think the show did as well as expected.', '2007-08-15 02:34:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(3999351, 567927, 80831, '<td valign="top">Well...i still think this should have scored better..Great Job!</td>', 'Well...i still think this should have scored better..Great Job!', '2007-08-15 03:14:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3999364, 567887, 52572, '<td valign="top">happy jason in parachute!<br/> <br/>:D<br/> <br/>congrats Jason!</td>', 'happy jason in parachute! :D congrats Jason!', '2007-08-15 03:21:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3999381, 567544, 68586, '<td valign="top">Oliver, great result and congrats on your ribbon. There is much to like about this picture - the perspective,the simplicity, strong clean lines and rule of thirds used perfectly. Well Done.<br/> <br/>By the way, in case my remark during the challenge was too cryptic it it was just a play on words. There is a well known (English) saying that goes "there''s no point in crying over spilt milk".  :  )</td>', 'Oliver, great result and congrats on your ribbon. There is much to like about this picture - the perspective,the simplicity, strong clean lines and rule of thirds used perfectly. Well Done. By the way, in case my remark during the challenge was too cryptic it it was just a play on words. There is a well known (English) saying that goes "there''s no point in crying over spilt milk".  :  )', '2007-08-15 03:27:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3999395, 567927, 63812, '<td valign="top">I also think this should have scored better. Anyway it''s really a cute photo and a very creative work. Congratulations!!<br/><i>(i''m afraid now he seriously not coming back)</i>  ;-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-08-15 03:19:22.</i></td>', 'I also think this should have scored better. Anyway it''s really a cute photo and a very creative work. Congratulations!!(i''m afraid now he seriously not coming back)  ;-)', '2007-08-15 03:34:12.000000', '2007-08-15 04:19:22.000000', 0),
