(4005457, 567806, 67697, '<td valign="top">I''m looking at the comments, and I sense that some have indeed lost touch with the simple fun of childhood.  :(  With that being said, I gave it a 6, because really, what kinds of "toys" is she going to be playing with at her age?  lol  I liked the focus on the girl and the horse.</td>', 'I''m looking at the comments, and I sense that some have indeed lost touch with the simple fun of childhood.  :(  With that being said, I gave it a 6, because really, what kinds of "toys" is she going to be playing with at her age?  lol  I liked the focus on the girl and the horse.', '2007-08-16 22:26:21.000000', NULL, 0),
