(4007898, 566823, 82112, '<td valign="top">Thanks.<br/> <br/>I spent a bit of time putting this shot together. <br/> <br/>I have to wonder how many voters took the time to ponder how difficult it is to get a shot from this perspective without the benefit of Photoshop. That''s part of the reason I thought it might score higher, along with the DOF and general humor. <br/> <br/>Regardless, still happy with the result for my first effort.<br/> <br/>I liked your entry too; glad to see it score well !<br/> <br/>-essay</td>', 'Thanks. I spent a bit of time putting this shot together.  I have to wonder how many voters took the time to ponder how difficult it is to get a shot from this perspective without the benefit of Photoshop. That''s part of the reason I thought it might score higher, along with the DOF and general humor.  Regardless, still happy with the result for my first effort. I liked your entry too; glad to see it score well ! -essay', '2007-08-17 21:45:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4011222, 567351, 32997, '<td valign="top">what a brilliant take on the challenge...much more than a cute or manipulated image, it drops right down to the level of the child, both visually and metaphorically...a true understanding of nuance and conflict...<br/>you really nailed this one!</td>', 'what a brilliant take on the challenge...much more than a cute or manipulated image, it drops right down to the level of the child, both visually and metaphorically...a true understanding of nuance and conflict...you really nailed this one!', '2007-08-19 15:31:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4011233, 567806, 66597, '<td valign="top">I read your comments and had a good giggle, because I''ve sometimes been prone to putting in DNMC photos even though I know what the result will be. But hey, you got a favorite, and that counts more than a good score in my book. This photo has very nice interaction between the horse and girl, and the color temp is spot on. But as you said, really doesn''t meet the challenge, so of course you were voted low despite it being a very solid photo.</td>', 'I read your comments and had a good giggle, because I''ve sometimes been prone to putting in DNMC photos even though I know what the result will be. But hey, you got a favorite, and that counts more than a good score in my book. This photo has very nice interaction between the horse and girl, and the color temp is spot on. But as you said, really doesn''t meet the challenge, so of course you were voted low despite it being a very solid photo.', '2007-08-19 15:35:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4011256, 567351, 66597, '<td valign="top">Don, I''ve been really impressed with your work lately, and this is no exception. Does it really fit into the toy challenge? No, but who cares. It''s a beautiful piece of work. It captures the emotive jealousy very well, and the relative size between the two boys as captured via your perspective adds tremendously. Adding to faves.</td>', 'Don, I''ve been really impressed with your work lately, and this is no exception. Does it really fit into the toy challenge? No, but who cares. It''s a beautiful piece of work. It captures the emotive jealousy very well, and the relative size between the two boys as captured via your perspective adds tremendously. Adding to faves.', '2007-08-19 15:42:08.000000', NULL, 0),
