(4014888, 564815, 43073, '<td valign="top">I honestly can''t believe the score and placement this received; well conceived, and I love the different lighting on the girl''s face; the black and white and the tones add a harshness here that seems appropriate to the message I''m taking away from it (which is along the lines of, toys aren''t what they used to be). Delightful. Fav''d.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-08-20 15:00:06.</i></td>', 'I honestly can''t believe the score and placement this received; well conceived, and I love the different lighting on the girl''s face; the black and white and the tones add a harshness here that seems appropriate to the message I''m taking away from it (which is along the lines of, toys aren''t what they used to be). Delightful. Fav''d.', '2007-08-20 15:59:21.000000', '2007-08-20 16:00:06.000000', 0),
(4015317, 567730, 24454, '<td valign="top">Well, I really LIKE this photo!  I think it is way underrated.  That baby doll looks like my little grandbaby Jackson, so it makes me sad thinking of that toy being all abandoned and rejected.   You did good and totally don''t deserve a 4.9 score with this!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Well, I really LIKE this photo!  I think it is way underrated.  That baby doll looks like my little grandbaby Jackson, so it makes me sad thinking of that toy being all abandoned and rejected.   You did good and totally don''t deserve a 4.9 score with this! ', '2007-08-20 18:13:52.000000', NULL, 0),
