(4030579, 564713, 3746, '<td valign="top">Hi Whiterook, you really need to try harder and not just enter something for the sake of it. Before entering a shot, do you ask yourself "Is this the best I can do for this challenge? Does it inspire? Do I feel that I have captured the essence of the scene?"<br/> <br/>Or do you just blindly click the button and hope for the best?<br/> <br/>Seriously, you need to take more time when thinking about entering a shot. Lots of people on this site will willingly offer you guidance. However, if you are just shooting for the hell of it the go for it dude!!</td>', 'Hi Whiterook, you really need to try harder and not just enter something for the sake of it. Before entering a shot, do you ask yourself "Is this the best I can do for this challenge? Does it inspire? Do I feel that I have captured the essence of the scene?" Or do you just blindly click the button and hope for the best? Seriously, you need to take more time when thinking about entering a shot. Lots of people on this site will willingly offer you guidance. However, if you are just shooting for the hell of it the go for it dude!!', '2007-08-26 21:03:37.000000', NULL, 0),
