(4310278, 567169, 82327, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by adrianodj:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice smille.... but where is the toy? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The mirror is the toy - it''s for babies to see themselves, I guess.  The bright handles and beads around the edge are supposed to attract their attention.</td>', 'Originally posted by adrianodj: Nice smille.... but where is the toy?   The mirror is the toy - it''s for babies to see themselves, I guess.  The bright handles and beads around the edge are supposed to attract their attention.', '2007-12-12 08:40:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4310283, 567169, 82327, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Moatz:</b></div><hr/><i> I really enjoyed your entry.  I was starting to get disappointed going through the entries, there were a lot of them that were very demented or depressing.  Your photo is what I think of when I think of a Childs Toy, happy and fun.  Great photo, 10! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks. :)</td>', 'Originally posted by Moatz: I really enjoyed your entry.  I was starting to get disappointed going through the entries, there were a lot of them that were very demented or depressing.  Your photo is what I think of when I think of a Childs Toy, happy and fun.  Great photo, 10!   Thanks. :)', '2007-12-12 08:41:48.000000', NULL, 0),
